{"candidateAnswer":"Several months of work","evidence":"[D3:1 | 7:03 pm on 1 February, 2023] Jolene: Hi Deb! How're you? I've been busy. My engineering professor gave us a huge robotics project. It's tough but fun, it's making me get creative and problem-solve.\n[D12:10 | 4:30 pm on 9 April, 2023] Jolene: Just so you know, I've been working on a big project lately - it's been tough but also really cool to watch it take shape. Can't wait to see the final result!\n[D13:1 | 3:56 pm on 6 June, 2023] Jolene: Hey Deborah! Long time no talk - I had lots of stuff going on. Remember the tough engineering project? I finally wrapped that up last month. Look at the result!","itemId":"urn:uuid:68816999-1148-5d2c-87aa-2667d274e17c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:75821852d49eb537f1cde7cec90ed74009148a2f54f8638cb128af8cf32a14d3","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How long did Jolene work on the robotics project given to her by her Professor?","referenceAnswer":"four months","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"75821852d49eb537f1cde7cec90ed74009148a2f54f8638cb128af8cf32a14d3"}}]}